<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (McGill University is proud to host the Conference on Sustainability in Engineering \(CSE\) 2027 from February 25th - 28th, 2027 in Montreal, Quebec, bringing together over 150 passionate students from across Canada to discuss and collaborate on sustainability in engineering. With your support, we hope to highlight work from across Canada, and help students focus on the technical side of sustainability. Through this conference, students can use this information to inform decisions within their campus and programs to help build a more sustainable future. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
