168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (This conference offers your organization the opportunity to connect with future engineering leaders, learn from expert speakers, network with delegates in professional and casual settings, and showcase the sustainable work you are doing to pave the way for our future engineers. Sponsors are given the opportunity to enjoy the sessions provided by the conference while also providing an opportunity for your organization to find like-minded individuals who are passionate about sustainability. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (We ask for your help as CSE is only possible through sponsor support. We hope to partner with your organization and cultivate an engineering community that is passionate about sustainability and building a greener future, capable of creating real change both in and out of university. On behalf of the whole organizing committee of CSE 2027, we thank you for considering this sponsorship opportunity, and hope to hear from you soon. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
